WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.450
Aoba-san.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.960
Searching for new messages.

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:52.960
You have no new e-mails.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.800
I'll try again!

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:02.970
Aoba Riku
Good evening

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:02.970
What are you doing now?
Please write back

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.810
If he doesn't reply to me this time...

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.940
Aoba Riku
Good evening

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.940
Do you want  to delete
this unsent message?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.990
An Exciting  Message

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.880
Board says: We're having our school trip now!! Wish you were here in Hokkaido!

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.560
In the end, he didn't reply to me yesterday.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.560
What about Friday?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.940
Aoba-san's coming back tomorrow evening, but...

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.150
Hey, Mii-chan.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:03.370
But the day after that is Sunday, so I won't be able to see him for a while.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.200
Hey, Mii-chan!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.620
This pasta isn't very good.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.540
Y-Yeah.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.050
You've been brooding like that for quite a while. What's wrong?

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.220
Sorry about that.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.180
I was spacing out.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.550
You were worried about Aoba-san again, weren't you?

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.140
Y-Yeah.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:28.810
Well...

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.850
Did something happen between you two?

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:34.770
I know!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.690
The second-years are all on their school trip.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.570
That's why it feels so empty here.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:44.280
Hey, Mii-chan.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.870
Wanna hang out with me after school today?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.790
O-Okay.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.290
I don't mind, but...

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.760
My eyes are so red.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.980
I look terrible.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.190
This won't do!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.110
I've got to practice hard at times like these!

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.610
Otherwise, Aoba-san will hate me.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:25.160
Okay! I'll ask Utsumi-senpai to help me train extra hard today!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.540
Um... Where's Utsumi-senpai?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.040
All the third-year students have a day off today.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.420
They have a day off?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:43.800
Listen, the third-years are getting ready for university entrance exams or job interviews,

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.340
so they've been busy lately.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.430
I see.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.680
So I was wondering if we should skip a day too.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:51.770
What?

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.100
Let's get changed and have some crepes.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.190
Okay!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.910
I'm all alone, even here.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:29.760
The rumors were true! They look great!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.060
Hey, Mii-chan.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.180
Why don't we check out this shop next?

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.140
Yeah.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.020
Books say: Furano. Otaru. Ultimate Guide. Hokkaido. Hokkaido.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:44.490
My heart is overflowing!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.860
Mii-chan!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.990
Y-Yay!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.460
I'm sorry.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.000
Geez! You're way too depressed, Mii-chan!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.710
Are you that worried about Aoba-san?

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:09.260
Well, I've sent him a lot of e-mails, but he hasn't replied at all.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.060
Then why don't just take the plunge and call him?

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:17.480
But if I call him, I might interrupt his school trip.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.480
E-mailing him would be no different.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.020
I... guess so.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.980
Of course it would!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:29.530
Aoba-san's on his school trip, so of course he's busy!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.070
Y-Yeah.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.450
I guess you're right. That's gotta be it.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.540
And besides...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.410
Besides?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.750
I think it's about time you thought about yourself for a change.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:43.960
Huh?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:48.880
We can't be with our senpais forever, after all.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.400
I guess she's right.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.860
Aoba-san's going to graduate before me.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:16.910
And when that happens, I won't be able to see him at school anymore.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.710
What should I do?

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.040
I should tell him how I feel as soon as I can.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.590
What am I saying?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.010
The moon...

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.530
Aoba-san.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.660
I...

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:55.820
I'll try again just one more time!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.990
Awkward, isn't it?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:13.380
Guests from Sakura Technical School

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:13.380
Guests from Tsumugino High School

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:13.380
Guests from Nissho Pty. Ltd.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.520
I'm so sorry, Kasuga-san.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:31.780
Kasuga-san?

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.530
R-Riku-kun.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.410
You look much better now.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:39.990
You should rest for a while longer.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.160
Riku-kun!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.080
Were you looking after me all this time?

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.090
I'm sorry.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:00.890
Thank goodness.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:01.930
H-Huh?

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.190
I didn't want to be a burden to you.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:07.560
That's why I...

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.190
Kasuga-san.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.940
All this time, I never understood how you felt about me.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:17.240
I thought I told you. "I don't want to be a burden to you."

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.780
So don't say anything.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.710
You've done enough for me already.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:37.760
I just want you to be quiet, and stay by my side.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.050
Kasuga-san.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.440
Let me see...

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.900
Where did I put it?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.950
I just stuffed it into my bag...

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.410
That's my mobile.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.370
Who would call me at this hour?

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.000
Crap!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:14.300
That's right. I never charged it up before we left on the trip.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.590
I forgot to bring my charger.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:20.800
Oh yeah!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.100
That must be...

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.640
Found it!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.100
Aoba! There you are!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.100
Wh-What's wrong, everyone?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.780
You know what night it is tonight, don't you?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.200
A-Are you planning to do something ridiculous again?

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.070
Hokkaido!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.450
This is the last night of our school trip!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.660
We have to make the last night the BEST night!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.500
We're gonna sneak into the girls' room tonight!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:50.710
W-We can't do that!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.090
What'll we do if Akaoni-sensei catches us?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.960
Do you have any idea what he'd do to us?

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:01.090
Your dreams will never come true if you're afraid of Akaoni.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.140
YEAH!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.720
I have to give this to Kasuga-san right now!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.440
Aoba-san.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.870
I'm Amamiya Sayuri.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.530
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.370
I'm Sakurai Haru.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.540
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:36.420
I didn't get a wink of sleep last night either.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.340
Aoba-san's coming back tonight.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:43.300
Mii-chan!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.220
Morning!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.600
Oh, Mo-chan.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.220
Morning.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.560
Mii-chan! What's up with your eyes?

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:51.890
They're bloodshot, aren't they?

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:53.480
Geez.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.400
Did you wait all night for him to send you a reply?

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.440
So? Did he send a reply?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:01.280
No.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.860
Cheer up.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:06.780
Aoba-san's coming back tonight, after all!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:08.660
Yeah.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.970
The second-years would normally be doing P.E. right now.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:31.980
We can't be with our senpais forever, after all.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.020
Even though we're just a year apart...

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.500
Someday... When that times comes...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.670
When that time comes, I'll surely...

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.060
Mii-chan. What should we do today?

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.850
Do you want to go hang out again?

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.860
I-I... I'm going home, so...

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:24.820
Mii-chan?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.670
M-Mii-chan?

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:44.840
Mii-chan!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:53.390
Geez. Thank goodness he didn't find us.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:59.730
I can't believe that Akaoni was guarding the girls' room!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:00.770
Yeah.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:05.400
The last night of our youths ended in vain.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.530
It's not the end of our youths.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:15.290
Well, to us, we'll get over our grief if we take in some of the wonderful Hokkaido scenery.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.410
Yeah.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.290
But it's more than we deserve.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.420
Yeah.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.290
It was a nice journey.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:27.050
Ah... Everyone really is free.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:42.520
Riku-kun.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:48.570
Wow! This is such a great view!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.950
It's the famous "million-dollar night view."

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:57.040
But now, it won't be easy to say farewell to Hokkaido after seeing this view.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.790
Hey, Sayuri!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.880
Isn't it lovely?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.210
C'mon, look!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.880
Wow! It really is lovely.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.180
Isn't it though?

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.560
Aoba-kun.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.440
Ama-

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.400
I-Is Kasuga-san all right?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.730
I heard that she collapsed yesterday, but...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.530
Y-Yeah. Her fever's almost completely gone.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:34.160
I see. Thank goodness.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.030
U-Um...

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:36.950
Amamiya-san...

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:41.080
Sayuri! I bet you can see Komagane Point from here!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.420
Let's check it out.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.000
O-Okay.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:11.990
Right now... that's the only place that will save me.

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:17.370
Could it be?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.250
Mo-chan

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.250
No Subject

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.250
Mii-chan where'd you go! .

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.290
It's from Mo-chan.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.180
Take me there now.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.400
I got myself some crab!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.940
Take that!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.070
Oh, by the way...

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.080
Amamiya-san.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.790
Have you been to...

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.620
Amamiya-san really is going out with Sakurai-kun.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.880
This is too cruel.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.880
Oh, this might be nice!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.260
Will Mina-chan be happy with this?

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:42.990
It's been a long time.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.660
Have you been well?

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.540
They really are beautiful.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:56.720
I hope I can see them with Aoba-san one day.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.220
Welcome, Transfer Student! This is Aoba Riku-kun!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:08.810
I've gone through hard times, and I've suffered, but...

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:12.690
You've given me so much encouragement.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.420
But even so...

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:39.170
Why won't he reply to me today?

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.590
Why hasn't he replied to me?

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.260
Doesn't he like me?

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.570
I... I...

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.570
I want to see you, Aoba-san!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:46.740
Okay!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.410
It's fully charged!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:49.950
Now then...

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.620
I'm pretty sure I missed a call.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.500
Huh? Why do I have so many messages?

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.040
Note: All the messages are from Yayoi Mina.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:00.420
You have one new voice-mail.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:07.050
Play message?

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:07.050
Yes

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:07.050
No

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.010
Aoba-san.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.300
I want to see you.

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:09.430
Textbooks say: Science and Classic Literature 2.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:27.900
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:43.440
Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:48.980
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:57.890
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:04.530
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:13.780
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:21.240
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.370
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:29.030
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:35.910
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:39.960
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:43.630
for the future we await, right?

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:49.940
My heart is overflowing!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.530
Next Episode Preview

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:53.910
I met you by accident. I'm sure of it.

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:55.660
That's what I thought at first.

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:57.370
We were just classmates.

00:23:57.830 --> 00:23:59.120
When did it begin?

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:03.420
You were with another girl, and I betrayed my own feelings.

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:06.920
Now it's even more painful.

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:09.920
It's because you stopped smiling at me.

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:11.950
That's why I...

