Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:14.900 --> 00:24:15.890
Exciting Feelings.

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:20.060
Exciting Feelings

00:24:15.990 --> 00:24:16.780
Please watch it!

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:19.190
My heart is trembling.
